			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 402070201,
					"content": "Hey, Ineffa! Oh, Jahoda! You're here, too?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070202,
					"content": "Well, after all that hard work, I at least deserve a slice of cake for my efforts, don't you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070203,
					"content": "Wait, there's cake!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070204,
					"content": "Yes. You two are here just in time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070205,
					"content": "Aino wanted to thank you for your help, so now that Krum-Clank is back safe and sound, she thought it would be nice for everyone to try out his baking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070206,
					"content": "Clank... clank...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070207,
					"content": "Wow, so this is what Krum-Clank was supposed to look like!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070208,
					"content": "Yes. Luckily, the core was still intact, so all Aino had to do was make a new body.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070209,
					"content": "Clank... clank...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070210,
					"content": "Ooh, is it ready?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070211,
					"content": "Gulp...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070212,
					"content": "Hey, he ate it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070213,
					"content": "It's not unusual for a chef to take a few bites before serving a dish.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Jahoda"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070214,
					"content": "No need to worry. Once he's had his fill, he can get started on the desserts for everyone else. It'll just be a moment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070215,
					"content": "Alright... Wait, speaking of desserts, where's Aino?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070216,
					"content": "Ah, she thought of a new idea for a robot and shut herself in the workshop to get started. When inspiration strikes, she jumps into action. That's just who she is.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070217,
					"content": "Why does Aino like building robots so much?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070218,
					"content": "Hm... Retrieving historical records from data bank...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070219,
					"content": "At first, I believe Aino was just shocked to find something that fascinated her more than desserts.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070220,
					"content": "And fortunately, her friends respected her passion — even if, aside from struggling to make ends meet, there was little time for much else.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070221,
					"content": "Then, one day, an acclaimed teacher discovered her and recognized her passion for what it truly was... genius.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070222,
					"content": "Just like her friends, she finally discovered what she wanted to do. And not only that, she excelled at it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070223,
					"content": "And when genius and passion collide, there's not much that can get in the way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070224,
					"content": "So, Aino left her childhood friends, established the Clink-Clank Krumkake Craftshop, and started making all kinds of robot companions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070225,
					"content": "Perhaps it all comes down to the natural instinct of a genius... the drive to see their imagination come to life.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070226,
					"content": "Oh... So that's what draws her to robotics?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070227,
					"content": "Based on my own experience with Aino, I think there's more to it than that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070228,
					"content": "Long before she took me in, she was already pushing her skills to the limit in an effort to give each robot a distinct personality, and she already treated them like companions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070229,
					"content": "What I mean is, it's not something that started with me, just because I have a unique background.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070230,
					"content": "I think, after walking the path of a genius for so long, she looked around and realized there was no one at her side, and it made her feel lonely.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070231,
					"content": "So, me, Krum-Clank, and all the other robots Aino has added to the workshop... We're not just proof of her genius.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070232,
					"content": "We're her family. We give her the companionship she longs for.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070233,
					"content": "As I see it, that's the true relationship between Aino and her robots.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070234,
					"content": "Oh, wow. So, you really mean a lot to her...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070235,
					"content": "Yes. And for that reason, it did not matter to Aino how powerful Krum-Clank could become, nor how feared or coveted his technology might be among the factions.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070236,
					"content": "And she decided that he would join this family, and that meant she would spare no effort to save him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070237,
					"content": "Yeah, that makes sense! But, it makes Paimon wonder why someone like Aino would choose to stay in Nod-Krai...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070238,
					"content": "...I'm afraid my logic unit cannot make sense of that question.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070239,
					"content": "Well, the way Paimon sees it, Nod-Krai is a dog-eat-dog place full of scheming and scamming. The people that thrive here seem to be built for that kind of thing.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070240,
					"content": "Anyone else would use the kind of tech Aino has to make weapons and threaten people.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070241,
					"content": "But Aino... she takes something that could be a weapon and turns it into a robot that makes cakes. It just doesn't seem like she fits in...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070242,
					"content": "No, my view is the exact opposite.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070243,
					"content": "I've encountered the full spectrum of people that live here in Nod-Krai. But, in my experience, very few of them can be said to represent this place.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070244,
					"content": "You say Aino doesn't fit in here, but I believe the opposite. If I were to attempt to define what a person from Nod-Krai should be... no one is a better match than Aino.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070245,
					"content": "Ding... Ding...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Krum-Clank 70% Sweet"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070246,
					"content": "Ooh, the desserts should be done!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070247,
					"content": "Yes. One moment. Allow me to serve them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070248,
					"content": "I want the one with the most frosting!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aino"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070249,
					"content": "Alright, everyone. Dig in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						402070250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ineffa"
				},
				{
					"id": 402070250,
					"content": "...Mmm! So worth it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}